hite Now Original lot de 3x75ml à 7,78 euros au lieu de 12,72 euros sur Amazon. Blancheur instantanée, 96% naturel, Choix Amazon.\",\"image\":\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/images/articles/bon-plan-signal-white-now-dentifrice-blancheur-lot-3-promo-amazon-2026.svg\",\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingValue\":4.5,\"bestRating\":5,\"ratingCount\":12},\"review\":{\"@type\":\"Review\",\"reviewRating\":{\"@type\":\"Rating\",\"ratingValue\":4.5,\"bestRating\":5},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BonsPlansMania\"},\"reviewBody\":\"Bon plan dentifrice Signal White Now Original lot de 3x75ml à 7,78 euros au lieu de 12,72 euros sur Amazon. Blancheur instantanée, 96% naturel, Choix Amazon.\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"url\":\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/article/bon-plan-signal-white-now-dentifrice-blancheur-lot-3-promo-amazon-2026\",\"price\":\"7.78\",\"priceCurrency\":\"EUR\",\"availability\":\"https://schema.org/InStock\"}}5:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Article\\\",\\\"headline\\\":\\\"Signal White Now Dentifrice Blancheur Lot de 3 a -39% sur Amazon : 7,78 euros les 3 tubes\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Bon plan dentifrice Signal White Now Original lot de 3x75ml à 7,78 euros au lieu de 12,72 euros sur Amazon. Blancheur instantanée, 96% naturel, Choix Amazon.\\\",\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2026-03-30\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2026-03-30\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/images/articles/bon-plan-signal-white-now-dentifrice-blancheur-lot-3-promo-amazon-2026.svg\\\",\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/article/bon-plan-signal-white-now-dentifrice-blancheur-lot-3-promo-amazon-2026\\\"},\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Bons Plans Mania\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\\\"},\\\"publisher\